Nova mobilna aplikacija NEO prinaša številne novosti. Ključne so boljša uporabniška izkušnja, intuitivna uporaba in upravljanje vsebin, zbirke vsebin na enem mestu in izboljšano delovanje.




Ključne prednosti mobilne aplikacije NEO:

•             brezžična preslikava videa, ki se predvaja v aplikaciji NEO, iz mobilne aplikacije na pametne televizorje in naprave, ki podpirajo tehnologijo Airplay;
•             preprosto upravljanje in ogled vsebin;
•             možnost pomanjšanja videopredvajalnika znotraj mobilne aplikacije in nemoteno brskanje po ostalih delih aplikacije;
•             intuitiven predvajalnik za radijske postaje;
•             enostavno urejanje vrstnega reda TV-programov; 
•             virtualni daljinec z možnostjo upravljanja različnih NEO Smartboxov;
•             glasovno upravljanje NEO Smartboxa z virtualnim daljincem.


Dobrodošli v novi svet, kjer vam NEO približa doživetje domače zabave na vseh zaslonih (TV, računalnik, mobitel) in kjer vsebine najdejo vas. NEO lahko spremljate povsod v EU.

The unofficial app for finding and tracking Netflix, HBO, Apple+, Hulu, Amazon: Prime, Paramount+ and more original shows, movies and their release dates, quickly and easily, you can not watch or stream anything in this app, other than trailers or teasers.

With so many streaming providers, it's hard to find and keep track of great original shows and movies. But now with Rivr's AI you can merge all the information from all your streaming services into one place or "river" of information, keep track of your favourite and discover new ones, and never miss an episode.

Quickly find all scheduled originals release dates, then get notified about changes and updates to the show or movie, including notifications about your favourite actors.

Keep track of what you watch by marking episodes and movies as watched, then rate them.

Set reminders for your favourite series release dates and get real-time notifications on changes, release dates and new trailers.

- Discover new content by streaming provider or genre;
- Subscription AI - Save on streaming services;
- Filter by Series, Movies or Documentaries;
- Mark episodes and movies as watched;
- Rate episodes and movies;
- Customised profile and recommendations;
- Season and episode rating charts;
- Compare ratings;
- Tabbed interface for easy navigating;
- Notification when the show is released;
- List of favourite shows, movies;
- Browse and Search for Original Shows/Movies;
- Browse by popular, rating, date, show, or movie;
- Watch Trailers;

Currently tracks original shows and movies from Netflix, HBO Max, Apple+, Hulu, Amazon Prime Video, Disney+, Paramount+, Discovery+, YouKu, Peacock, showtime, AMC+, adult swim, the CW, and FX.

Rivr is funded by ads, if you choose to purchase Rivr Pro to hide these ads, unlock Subscription AI, Premium notifications, and unlimited favourite and follows, payment will be charged to your iTunes account, and your account will be charged for renewal 24 hours prior to the end of the current period. Auto-renewal may be turned off at any time by going to your settings in the iTunes Store after purchase.

Purchasing Rivr Pro will not allow you to stream or watch any content, shows, or movies.

